    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Description\n\nAdd a special mode (!) for not including (excluding) or filtering out certain results from list.\nFor example: ['abc' , 'def' , 'ghi' , 'ghijkl' , 'world'] is the list\nif the query is \"!'ghi\" means ! (don't include) 'ghi (exactly 'ghi') in the list\nresults after query = ['abc', 'def', 'world']",
