    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nI did consider adding this, but it felt like adding too much of complexity to [already complex set of modes](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/8f0969dd976e4f0cb8e2898596fa2eab18ce676b/doc/mini-pick.txt#L893-L908). It is possible to write own `config.source.match`, though, that has this rule plus uses [`default_match()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/8f0969dd976e4f0cb8e2898596fa2eab18ce676b/doc/mini-pick.txt#L938).\n\nClosing as \"not planned, but it might change in the future if default match is refactored to be less complex\".",
